  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Vrathur was said to ally with asuran fiends, intent on demolishing the fortresses of the Aelkhazak’s enemies – and eventually, Ixu’na’gaszh itself. Your selectiveness about things worth creating also applies to things you wish to destroy. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.QLeMH5mQgh28sa5o]{Specialty Crafting} feat a second time for a different specialization. Any time you Strike a creature with the Construct trait, or is a creature that has to do with materials used in your Specialty Crafting selection, you ignore up to 5 points of their hardness or resistance to physical damage. This increases to 7 points at 13th level, and 9 points at 17th level.</span></p>"
